## 3. Your business model should be value-based, not cost-based

Your VPS cost being around **USD 7/month** is great for margin, but it is mostly irrelevant for pricing. **Agents buy based on perceived value, not your infrastructure cost.**

If your service helps an agent:

- win even **1 extra listing**
- impress sellers in listing presentations
- stand out on social
- deliver better marketing than competitors

then the value is much higher than cheap-video pricing.

