## 24. Important risk areas you should handle early

### 1. Rights and permissions
Make sure your terms require the agent/customer to confirm they have the right to use:
- listing photos
- branding
- logos
- descriptions

This matters especially with MLS and portal content.

### 2. Compliance
Different markets have rules around:
- property marketing claims
- fair housing language
- required disclosures
- brokerage attribution

Build a simple disclaimer and allow agent-specific compliance text.

### 3. Edge-case listings
Not every listing page will be perfect.  
Have a fallback:
- paste URL
- if data is incomplete, agent uploads missing photos or text

### 4. Quality control
At scale, bad videos will hurt faster than good videos help.
Have:
- automated checks
- quick human QA for new/brokerage clients
- pronunciation overrides

